  <description>Blue boundary board: 0.80 m (length, local X) x 0.50 m (height, local Z). Thickness 0.02 m is a modelling assumption (rule unconfirmed, see docs/assumptions.md). Origin: centre of the bottom edge; local X = length, local Y = thickness, local Z = height; pose z=0 stands on the ground. static=true - test-only.</description>
</model>
